<title>USA: Orthodontic Centers to join smallcap index.</title>
<headline>Orthodontic Centers to join smallcap index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it will replace Vivra Inc in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index with Orthodontic Centers of America Inc after the close of trading on Friday, June 6, 1997.</p>
<p>Vivra is being acquired by Incentive AB, a Swedish company, in a friendly cash tender offer scheduled to expire on that date.</p>
<p>Orthodontic Centers develops and manages a chain of orthodontic practices.</p>
</text>
